From 19571e0a2b42340597fd762803f6eb9d030ee4c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex-Pennington <alex.pennington@organicengineer.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Dec 2025 09:01:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add Codec2 vocoder (LGPL) - open source voice codec

- Codec2 by David Rowe VK5DGR - LGPL licensed, safe for public repo
- New Codec2 tab in GUI with 700C-3200 bps modes
- 700C mode optimized for HF radio (182:1 compression)
- Full audio file selection and playback
- MELPe remains for private MARS builds
